<title>UK: Bank of Nova Scotia sets $200 mln two-yr Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Bank of Nova Scotia sets $200 mln two-yr Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    14.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.91    PAY DATE    14.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.96     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    CANADA    HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  0.95	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 28.FEB.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
